{"ticker":"AEP","updated":"2026-10-23T22:34:40Z","profile":{"longName":"American Electric Power Company, Inc.","shortName":"American Electric Power Company","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aep.com","fullTimeEmployees":17581,"marketCap":70602899456,"trailingPE":22.476604,"forwardPE":18.866772,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0978413,"pegRatio":2.38,"targetMeanPrice":141.49565,"targetHighPrice":173.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.07,"earningsGrowth":-0.432,"grossMargins":0.46352002,"operatingMargins":0.23251,"profitMargins":0.13781999,"totalRevenue":22791000064,"beta":0.469,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":140.58,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":112.54,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.97},"summary":"American Electric Power Company, Inc., an electric public utility holding company, engages in the generation, transmission, and distribution of electricity for sale to retail and wholesale customers in the United States. It operates through Vertically Integrated Utilities, Transmission and Distribution Utilities, AEP Transmission Holdco, and Generation & Marketing segments. The company generates electricity using coal and lignite, nuclear, natural gas, renewable, hydro, solar, wind, and other energy sources; owns, operates, maintains, and invests in transmission infrastructure; and engages in the retail supply, and wholesale energy trading and marketing businesses. It operates approximately 252,000 circuit miles of distribution lines; 38,000 circuit miles of transmission lines; and 25,000 MWs of regulated owned generating capacity. American Electric Power Company, Inc. was incorporated in 1906 and is headquartered in Columbus, Ohio.","summary_zh":"美國電力公司 (American Electric Power Company, Inc.) 是一家電力公用事業控股公司，從事發電、輸電和配電業務，並向美國的零售和批發客戶銷售電力。該公司透過垂直整合公用事業部門、輸電和配電公用事業部門、AEP 輸電控股公司以及發電和行銷部門進行營運。該公司使用煤炭和褐煤、核能、天然氣、再生能源、水力、太陽能、風能和其他能源發電；擁有、營運、維護和投資傳輸基礎設施；從事零售供應、批發能源交易和行銷業務。它運營約 252,000 英里的配電線路； 38,000 電路英里的輸電線路；以及 25,000 兆瓦的受監管自有發電容量。美國電力公司成立於 1906 年，總部位於俄亥俄州哥倫布市。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":113.7,"h":114.34,"l":112.89,"c":113.01,"v":2332100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":113.33,"h":113.33,"l":112.22,"c":112.63,"v":4310200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":112.63,"h":113.25,"l":112.47,"c":112.89,"v":3328100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":113.0,"h":113.17,"l":111.56,"c":111.78,"v":3697300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":111.5,"h":111.64,"l":110.7,"c":111.02,"v":2896200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":110.96,"h":111.14,"l":109.65,"c":110.09,"v":2528600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":110.25,"h":110.33,"l":108.85,"c":110.03,"v":2429800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":110.54,"h":110.73,"l":106.94,"c":108.64,"v":5218200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":109.0,"h":109.16,"l":107.35,"c":108.11,"v":3664400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":108.22,"h":108.3,"l":106.87,"c":107.55,"v":2708100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":107.29,"h":108.58,"l":107.13,"c":108.36,"v":2678700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":108.43,"h":108.82,"l":107.59,"c":108.34,"v":2528600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":108.34,"h":108.93,"l":108.13,"c":108.74,"v":2634600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":108.66,"h":109.72,"l":108.51,"c":109.46,"v":2180700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":109.44,"h":109.78,"l":108.72,"c":109.1,"v":2511600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":109.1,"h":109.14,"l":106.61,"c":106.84,"v":4044500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":107.51,"h":107.93,"l":107.11,"c":107.52,"v":2540200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":107.11,"h":107.33,"l":106.3,"c":106.44,"v":2513400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":106.55,"h":107.63,"l":105.7,"c":107.06,"v":5846000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":106.95,"h":107.38,"l":106.12,"c":107.05,"v":2645900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":106.78,"h":108.37,"l":106.78,"c":108.14,"v":3052200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":108.26,"h":109.59,"l":108.09,"c":108.88,"v":3029100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":109.33,"h":109.97,"l":107.78,"c":107.86,"v":2758000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":108.37,"h":109.51,"l":108.15,"c":109.14,"v":3303000},{"t":"20